      "detailed_description": "<h1>contact</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More information on discord : </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Gods Wars : &quot;Gods Wars: Infinity Epic&quot; is a gorgeous action roguelike game that offers a fresh take on the genre. Featuring multiple characters, numerous bosses, and various New Game+ , it includes 9 playable characters and 6 worlds. Here, you'll have access to a wide range of equipment and face off against various types of monsters and bosses. Join in and create your unique play style!<br><br>DISCORD：<br><br>The Game’s Various Versions<br>【Gods Wars-Fallen Angel】<br>【Gods Wars Side Story-Sin and Punishment】<br>【Gods Wars Ⅱ-Reborn】<br>【Gods Wars Ⅲ】<br>【Gods Wars Ex-Vampire】<br>【Gods Wars Ⅳ-Rise of War-God】<br><br>Exciting Combat, Infinite Possibilities<br>The game features multiple characters, numerous bosses, and a wealth of content. It features 9 playable characters, each with unique professions and attributes, allowing players to craft diverse builds and play styles.<br>The game includes 6 worlds, where players can challenge a variety of monsters and bosses and collect diverse equipment. You can expect over About 50 hours of gameplay!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/a0ec3f2608c237e63ff5fbbf787159c6.poster.avif?t=1761724936\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/a0ec3f2608c237e63ff5fbbf787159c6.webm?t=1761724936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/a0ec3f2608c237e63ff5fbbf787159c6.mp4?t=1761724936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/01e1c0a1de4aeff91e8b00a870adca74.poster.avif?t=1761724936\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/01e1c0a1de4aeff91e8b00a870adca74.webm?t=1761724936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/01e1c0a1de4aeff91e8b00a870adca74.mp4?t=1761724936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Freedom to Customize, Different variations<br>Switch between 9 different weapon types—bows, shields, swords, magic wands, daggers, staffs, claws, maces, and axes—freely.<br>With over 600 pieces of equipment, you can create a combat style that uniquely yours.<br>You’ll also have over 200 pets to fight with you, each with distinct attributes, and more than 180 artifacts to discover!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/652e5514fcc29fff516dc911abb36e46.poster.avif?t=1761724936\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/652e5514fcc29fff516dc911abb36e46.webm?t=1761724936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/652e5514fcc29fff516dc911abb36e46.mp4?t=1761724936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/da43ff7a0ed9764a6a880f686c1cbdf1.poster.avif?t=1761724936\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/da43ff7a0ed9764a6a880f686c1cbdf1.webm?t=1761724936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/da43ff7a0ed9764a6a880f686c1cbdf1.mp4?t=1761724936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Tips:<br>At the respawn point, choose your profession, artifact, and deity.<br>Complete the NPC task in the first level as soon as possible and unlock the merchants in the Divine Kingdom.<br>Before starting the level, talk to the blacksmith and craft a handy weapon.<br>Take a stroll around the city to acquire some initial items and pets.<br><br>Supports mouse, keyboard, and controller.",
      "about_the_game": "Gods Wars : &quot;Gods Wars: Infinity Epic&quot; is a gorgeous action roguelike game that offers a fresh take on the genre. Featuring multiple characters, numerous bosses, and various New Game+ , it includes 9 playable characters and 6 worlds. Here, you'll have access to a wide range of equipment and face off against various types of monsters and bosses. Join in and create your unique play style!<br><br>DISCORD：<br><br>The Game’s Various Versions<br>【Gods Wars-Fallen Angel】<br>【Gods Wars Side Story-Sin and Punishment】<br>【Gods Wars Ⅱ-Reborn】<br>【Gods Wars Ⅲ】<br>【Gods Wars Ex-Vampire】<br>【Gods Wars Ⅳ-Rise of War-God】<br><br>Exciting Combat, Infinite Possibilities<br>The game features multiple characters, numerous bosses, and a wealth of content. It features 9 playable characters, each with unique professions and attributes, allowing players to craft diverse builds and play styles.<br>The game includes 6 worlds, where players can challenge a variety of monsters and bosses and collect diverse equipment. You can expect over About 50 hours of gameplay!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/a0ec3f2608c237e63ff5fbbf787159c6.poster.avif?t=1761724936\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/a0ec3f2608c237e63ff5fbbf787159c6.webm?t=1761724936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/a0ec3f2608c237e63ff5fbbf787159c6.mp4?t=1761724936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/01e1c0a1de4aeff91e8b00a870adca74.poster.avif?t=1761724936\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/01e1c0a1de4aeff91e8b00a870adca74.webm?t=1761724936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/01e1c0a1de4aeff91e8b00a870adca74.mp4?t=1761724936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Freedom to Customize, Different variations<br>Switch between 9 different weapon types—bows, shields, swords, magic wands, daggers, staffs, claws, maces, and axes—freely.<br>With over 600 pieces of equipment, you can create a combat style that uniquely yours.<br>You’ll also have over 200 pets to fight with you, each with distinct attributes, and more than 180 artifacts to discover!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/652e5514fcc29fff516dc911abb36e46.poster.avif?t=1761724936\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/652e5514fcc29fff516dc911abb36e46.webm?t=1761724936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/652e5514fcc29fff516dc911abb36e46.mp4?t=1761724936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/da43ff7a0ed9764a6a880f686c1cbdf1.poster.avif?t=1761724936\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/da43ff7a0ed9764a6a880f686c1cbdf1.webm?t=1761724936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510760/extras/da43ff7a0ed9764a6a880f686c1cbdf1.mp4?t=1761724936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Tips:<br>At the respawn point, choose your profession, artifact, and deity.<br>Complete the NPC task in the first level as soon as possible and unlock the merchants in the Divine Kingdom.<br>Before starting the level, talk to the blacksmith and craft a handy weapon.<br>Take a stroll around the city to acquire some initial items and pets.<br><br>Supports mouse, keyboard, and controller.",
